# 001100-001199/20220728T232156Z_1101029113.wiki
zΔ⚡b|=35a7|+ 24'''a'''%0A %0A ''This paragraph contains''%0A ''important new additions''%0A ''to this document.''%0A .%0A 17'''c'''%0A ''check this document. On''%0A .%0A 11,15'''d'''%0A 0'''a'''%0A ''This is an important''%0A ''notice! It should''%0A ''therefore be located at''%0A ''the beginning of this''%0A ''document!''%0A %0A .%0A%0AIn order to transform the content of file ''original'' into the content of file ''new'' using {{Mono%7Ced}}, we should append two lines to this diff file, one line containing a <code>w</code> (write) command, and one containing a <code>q</code> (quit) command (e.g. by {{code%7Clang%3Dbash%7Cprintf "w\nq\n" >> mydiff}}). Here we gave the diff file the name ''mydiff'' and the transformation will then happen when we run {{code%7Clang%3Dbash%7Ced %2Ds original < mydiff}}.%0A%0A|=62b7|
