zΔ⚡b|=625f|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Cauthor%3DE. Myers%7Ctitle%3DAn O(ND) Difference Algorithm and Its Variations%7Cjournal%3DAlgorithmica%7Cvolume%3D1%7Cissue%3D2%7Cyear%3D1986%7Cpages%3D251–266%7Cdoi%3D10.1007/BF01840446%7Cciteseerx%3D10.1.1.4.6927%7Cs2cid%3D6996809}}</ref>|=3f|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Cauthor1%3DWebb Miller %7Cauthor2%3DEugene W. Myers %7Ctitle%3DA File Comparison Program%7Cjournal%3DSoftware: Practice and Experience%7Cvolume%3D15%7Cissue%3D11%7Cyear%3D1985%7Cpages%3D1025–1040%7Cdoi%3D10.1002/spe.4380151102%7Cciteseerx%3D10.1.1.189.70 %7Cs2cid%3D15489614 }}</ref>|=70|+[[|=c|+]]|=1|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Cauthor%3DEsko Ukkonen%7Ctitle%3DAlgorithms for Approximate String Matching%7Cvolume%3D64%7Cjournal%3DInformation and Control%7Cissue%3D1–3%7Cyear%3D1985%7Cpages%3D100–118 %7C doi %3D 10.1016/S0019%2D9958(85)80046%2D2%7Cdoi%2Daccess%3Dfree}}</ref>|=67|+[[|=7|+]]|=dc|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=13|+<ref>[https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/ GNU Diff utilities] {{Webarchive%7Curl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20150316032418/http://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/ %7Cdate%3D2015%2D03%2D16 }}. Made available by the [[Free Software Foundation]]. Free Documentation. Free source code.</ref>|=80|+<ref>{{cite web %7Clast1%3DWaugh %7Cfirst1%3DTim %7Ctitle%3Dtwaugh/patchutils %7Cwebsite%3D[[GitHub]] %7Curl%3Dhttps://github.com/twaugh/patchutils %7Cdate%3D12 June 2020 %7Caccess%2Ddate%3D28 June 2020 %7Carchive%2Ddate%3D1 October 2020 %7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20201001234609/https://github.com/twaugh/patchutils %7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive }}</ref>|=ed|+{{citation needed%7Cdate%3DFebruary 2015}}{{discuss%7Ctopicality of front%2Dends}}|=2|+[[|=5|+]]|=e3|+[[|=1|+evision |=1|+ontrol |=1|+ystem%7CRCS]]|=6|+[[merge (revision control)%7C|=7|+]]|=1|+<ref>{{cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.gnu.org/software/rcs/manual/html_node/merge.html%7Ctitle%3Dmerge (GNU RCS 5.10.0)%7Cwebsite%3Dgnu.org%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D22 January 2021%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D18 September 2019%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20190918125803/http://www.gnu.org/software/rcs/manual/html_node/merge.html%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref>|=2|+[[|=5|+]]|=5|+[[|=5|+]]|=90|+[[|=4|+(text editor)%7CVim]] |=61|+<ref>{{Cite web%7Cauthor%2Dlink%3DBram Moolenaar%7Cfirst%3DBram%7Clast%3DMoolenaar%7Curl%3Dhttps://vimhelp.org/diff.txt.html#vimdiff%7Ctitle%3DVim documentation: diff%7Cwebsite%3Dvimdoc.sourceforge.net%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D1 May 2020%7Cquote%3DThe easiest way to start editing in diff mode is with the "vimdiff" command. This starts Vim as usual, and additionally sets up for viewing the differences between the arguments. <code>vimdiff file1 file2 [file3] [file4] [...file8]</code> This is equivalent to: <code>vim %2Dd file1 file2 [file3] [file4] [...file8]</code>%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D16 February 2020%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20200216203940/https://vimhelp.org/diff.txt.html#vimdiff%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref>|=3f|+[[|=3|+]]|=55|+<ref name%3D"brabandt2018">{{Cite web%7Ctitle%3DThe power of diff%7Curl%3Dhttps://vimways.org/2018/the%2Dpower%2Dof%2Ddiff/%7Cdate%3D1 December 2018%7Cwebsite%3DVimways%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D1 May 2020%7Cfirst%3DChristian %7Clast%3DBrabandt%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20181202020105/https://vimways.org/2018/the%2Dpower%2Dof%2Ddiff/%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D2 December 2018}}</ref>|=6|+[[|=5|+]]<ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.gnu.org/software/wdiff/wdiff.html%7Ctitle%3Dgnu.org%7Cwebsite%3Dwww.gnu.org%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D2020%2D09%2D12%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D2020%2D08%2D11%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20200811124535/https://www.gnu.org/software/wdiff/wdiff.html%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref>|=139|+<ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.colordiff.org/%7Ctitle%3Dcolordiff%7Cwebsite%3Dwww.colordiff.org%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D2018%2D06%2D14%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D2018%2D06%2D14%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20180614121429/https://www.colordiff.org/%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref>|=ab|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Clast1%3DHorwitz%7Cfirst1%3DSusan%7Ctitle%3DIdentifying the semantic and textual differences between two versions of a program%7Cjournal%3DACM SIGPLAN Notices%7Cdate%3DJune 1990%7Cvolume%3D25%7Cissue%3D6%7Cpages%3D234–245%7Cdoi%3D10.1145/93548.93574%7Curl%3Dhttp://www.cs.wisc.edu/wpis/papers/sigplan90.ps%7Cciteseerx%3D10.1.1.49.3377%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D2017%2D11%2D01%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D2010%2D06%2D12%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20100612103752/http://www.cs.wisc.edu/wpis/papers/sigplan90.ps%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal%7Clast1%3DYang%7Cfirst1%3DWuu%7Ctitle%3DIdentifying syntactic differences between two programs%7Cjournal%3DSoftware: Practice and Experience%7Cdate%3DJuly 1991%7Cvolume%3D21%7Cissue%3D7%7Cpages%3D739–755%7Cdoi%3D10.1002/spe.4380210706%7Cciteseerx%3D10.1.1.13.9377%7Cs2cid%3D10853673}}</ref><ref>Grass. Cdiff: A syntax directed Diff for C%2B%2B programs. Proceedings USENIX C%2B%2B Conf., pp. 181%2D193, 1992</ref>|=28|+<ref>Compare%2B%2B, http://www.coodesoft.com/ {{Webarchive%7Curl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20111129033738/http://www.coodesoft.com/ %7Cdate%3D2011%2D11%2D29 }}</ref><ref>SmartDifferencer, http://www.semanticdesigns.com/Products/SmartDifferencer {{Webarchive%7Curl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20091014160445/http://www.semanticdesigns.com/Products/SmartDifferencer/ %7Cdate%3D2009%2D10%2D14 }}</ref>|=5e|+<ref>{{cite web %7Ctitle%3Dxaizek/zograscope %7Curl%3Dhttps://github.com/xaizek/zograscope %7Cwebsite%3DGitHub %7Cdate%3D26 May 2020 %7Caccess%2Ddate%3D27 June 2020 %7Carchive%2Ddate%3D21 December 2020 %7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20201221105419/https://github.com/xaizek/zograscope %7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive }}</ref>|=13|+<ref>''DaisyDiff'', https://code.google.com/p/daisydiff/ {{Webarchive%7Curl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20150319014218/http://code.google.com/p/daisydiff/ %7Cdate%3D2015%2D03%2D19 }}</ref>|=50|+<ref>''xmldiffpatch'', http://msdn.microsoft.com