zΔ⚡b|=6ccb|-1c0|=b3f|-c|=9|-14|=44|-1|+colorization fo|=1|+ add|=1|-3|+d|=1|-3|+a|=1|+d dele|=1|-3|+ed|=1|-5|+b|=1|-2|=1|-3|+s|=ea|+}}</ref> diff%2Dso%2Dfancy and diff%2Dhighlight are newer analogues.<ref>{{cite web %7Ctitle%3Ddiff%2Dso%2Dfancy %7Curl%3Dhttps://github.com/so%2Dfancy/diff%2Dso%2Dfancy %7Cpublisher%3DSo Fancy %7Cdate%3D6 May 2023}}</ref> "delta" is a Rust rewrite that highlights changes and the underlying code at the same time, using its own diff algorithm.<ref>{{cite web %7Clast1%3DDavison %7Cfirst1%3DDan %7Ctitle%3Ddandavison/delta %7Curl%3Dhttps://github.com/dandavison/delta %7Cdate%3D8 May 2023}}</ref>%0A%0A'''Patchutils''' contains tools that combine, rearrange, compare and fix context diffs and unified diffs.<ref>{{cite web %7Clast1%3DWaugh %7Cfirst1%3DTim %7Ctitle%3Dtwaugh/patchutils %7Cwebsite%3D[[GitHub]] %7Curl%3Dhttps://github.com/twaugh/patchutils %7Cdate%3D12 June 2020 %7Caccess%2Ddate%3D28 June 2020 %7Carchive%2Ddate%3D1 October 2020 %7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20201001234609/https://github.com/twaugh/patchutils %7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive |=245d|
